        <div class="body">
          <div class="t">Connect your traffic</div>
          <div class="b">Route calls through us or send us request and response pairs. We automatically group your calls by the job they are doing.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-card">
        <div class="hdr"><span class="m p">Step 2</span></div>
        <div class="art"><svg viewBox="0 0 370 168" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Sampled calls from one job priced on four models, the cheapest one that clears the quality bar marked chosen, and what you run today at the bottom for scale."><text x="250" y="15" text-anchor="end" class="m" font-size="7" fill="var(--mut)">COST</text><text x="280" y="15" class="m" font-size="7" fill="var(--mut)">QUALITY BAR</text><line x1="256" y1="20" x2="256" y2="150" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line><rect x="6" y="26" width="96" height="92" rx="9" fill="var(--raise)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.2"></rect><text x="54" y="42" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">invoice-extract</text><rect x="14" y="50" width="76" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="var(--brandq)"></rect><circle cx="20" cy="54.5" r="2.8" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><rect x="14" y="62" width="76" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="var(--brandq)"></rect><circle cx="20" cy="66.5" r="2.8" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><rect x="14" y="74" width="76" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="var(--brandq)"></rect><circle cx="20" cy="78.5" r="2.8" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><rect x="14" y="86" width="76" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="var(--brandq)"></rect><circle cx="20" cy="90.5" r="2.8" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><rect x="14" y="98" width="76" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="var(--brandq)"></rect><circle cx="20" cy="102.5" r="2.8" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><text x="54" y="131" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="8" fill="var(--mut)">sampled calls</text><path d="M104 60 C118 60 114 37 126 37" fill="none" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M104 68 C118 68 114 69 126 69" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M104 80 C118 80 114 101 126 101" fill="none" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M104 92 C118 92 114 133 126 133" fill="none" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-das