        <div class="body">
          <div class="t">Auto-run randomized trials</div>
          <div class="b">We sample your real traffic, test it across multiple models, and measure accuracy, performance, and cost against your current model.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-card">
        <div class="hdr"><span class="m p">Step 3</span></div>
        <div class="art"><svg viewBox="0 0 370 168" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Quality held above the bar across five months while cost per month falls from two hundred and twelve dollars to seventy four, with the months a model was re-tested or switched called out."><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4" fill="var(--brand)"></circle><text x="21" y="11" class="m" font-size="8" fill="var(--mut)">Cost</text><circle cx="60" cy="8" r="4" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><text x="69" y="11" class="m" font-size="8" fill="var(--mut)">Quality</text><path d="M278 8 h22" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="4 3"></path><text x="306" y="11" class="m" font-size="8" fill="var(--mut)">Quality bar</text><rect x="24.1" y="16" width="51.8" height="16" rx="8" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></rect><text x="50.0" y="27" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="7" fill="var(--mut)">re-tested</text><path d="M50 32 V44" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 2"></path><rect x="157.6" y="16" width="72.8" height="16" rx="8" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></rect><text x="194.0" y="27" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="7" fill="var(--mut)">switched model</text><path d="M194 32 V40" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 2"></path><rect x="312.1" y="16" width="51.8" height="16" rx="8" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"></rect><text x="338.0" y="27" text-anchor="middle" class="m" font-size="7" fill="var(--mut)">re-tested</text><path d="M338 32 V42" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 2"></path><path d="M50 52 L122 58 L194 48 L266 60 L338 50 L338 72 L50 72 Z" fill="var(--ok)" opacity="0.10"></path><path d="M50 52 L122 58 L194 48 L266 60 L338 50" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="50" cy="52" r="7" fill="var(--ok)"></circle><path d="M47.0 52 L48.9 54.1 L53.2 49.6" fi